vg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 6l16 16M22 6L6 22"></path></svg></button></div><nav style="flex:1"><a class="mob-link" href="/">Home</a><a class="mob-link" href="/electrical">Electrical</a><a class="mob-link" href="/heat-pumps">Heat Pumps</a><a class="mob-sublink" href="/heat-pumps/commercial">- Commercial Heat Pumps</a><a class="mob-sublink" href="/heat-pumps/residential">- Residential Heat Pumps</a><a class="mob-sublink" href="/heat-pumps/new-builds">- New Build Heat Pumps</a><a class="mob-link" href="/air-conditioning">Air Conditioning</a><a class="mob-sublink" href="/air-conditioning/commercial">- Commercial AC</a><a class="mob-sublink" href="/air-conditioning/residential">- Residential AC</a><a class="mob-sublink" href="/air-conditioning/new-builds">- New Build AC</a><a class="mob-link" href="/projects">Projects</a><a class="mob-link" href="/products">Products</a><a class="mob-link" href="/blog">Blog &amp; Guides</a><a class="mob-link" href="/about">About Us</a><a class="mob-link" href="/contact">Contact</a><a class="mob-link" style="color:#f0cc58" href="/products?filter=special">Winter Specials</a></nav><div style="margin-top:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><a href="tel:093090070" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#37b8f4;color:#fff;padding:18px;font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;transition:background 0.2s;gap:8px"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6.62 10.79a15.05 15.05 0 006.59 6.59l2.2-2.2a1 1 0 011.01-.24 11.47 11.47 0 003.6.57 1 1 0 011 1V20a1 1 0 01-1 1A17 17 0 013 4a1 1 0 011-1h3.5a1 1 0 011 1c0 1.25.2 2.45.57 3.57a1 1 0 01-.25 1.02l-2.2 2.2z"></path></svg>09 309 0070</a><a style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#f0cc58;color:#000;padding:18px;font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;transition:background 0.2s" href="/contact">Book a Free Consultation</a></div></div><main><div><div id="hero-outer"><div id="hero" style="min-height:55vh;max-height:560px"><div id="hero-bg" style="background-image:url(&quot;/about.webp&quot;)"></div><div id="hero-overlay"></div><div class="hero-content"><div id="hero-left" style="max-width:640px"><h1>The team behind<br/>the work.</h1><p>Auckland&#x27;s electrical and air conditioning specialists - built on doing the job right, first time.</p></div></div></div></div><section style="width:100%;background:#fff;padding:96px 0"><div class="wrap"><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(48px,6vw,96px);align-items:start"><div><h2 style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(2.2rem,3.5vw,3.2rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-2px;color:#005592;margin-bottom:28px">Who we are</h2><p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:#444;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:20px">Trident Electrical &amp; Air Conditioning is an Auckland-based team specialising in residential and commercial electrical work, heat pump installation, and air conditioning systems.</p><p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:#444;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:20px">We work across all of Auckland - from the North Shore and CBD to East, West and South Auckland. Whether it&#x27;s a single split system, a full commercial fit-out, or a new build from plans - we show up on time, do it properly, and leave things tidy.</p><p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:#444;line-height:1.85">Trident is a licensed, fully accredited team. We&#x27;re authorised installers for Mitsubishi Electric and Panasonic, and certified Evnex EV charger installers.</p></div><div><img src="/Trident-8690.webp" alt="Trident team on site" style="width:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover;height:480px"/></div></div></div></section><section style="width:100%;background:#005592;padding:72px 0"><div class="wrap"><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08)"><div style="background:#005592;padding:40px 32px;text-align:center"><div style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,3.6rem);color:#f0cc58;letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:10px">500+</div><div style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)">Jobs completed</div></div><div style="background:#005592;padding:40px 32px;text-align:center"><div style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,3.6rem);color:#f0cc58;letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:10px">4.9★</div><div style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)">Google rating</div></div><div style="background:#005592;padding:40px 32px;text-align:center"><div style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,3.6rem);color:#f0cc58;letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:10px">10yr</div><div style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)">Serving Auckland</div></div><div style="background:#005592;padding:40px 32px;text-align:center"><div style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,3.6rem);color:#f0cc58;letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:10px">100%</div><div style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)">Licensed team</div></div></div></div></section><section style="width:100%;background:#f4f6f9;padding:96px 0"><div class="wrap"><div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:64px"><h2 style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(2.2rem,3.5vw,3.2rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-2px;color:#005592;margin-bottom:0">How we work</h2></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px"><div style="background:#fff;padding:40px 36px;border-top:3px solid #f0cc58"><h3 style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:#021225;margin-bottom:16px;letter-spacing:-0.3px">We show up on time.</h3><p style="font-size:15px;color:#555;line-height:1.8">No chasing, no excuses. We respect your time and your project. When we say we&#x27;ll be there, we&#x27;re there.</p></div><div style="background:#fff;padding:40px 36px;border-top:3px solid #f0cc58"><h3 style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:#021225;margin-bottom:16px;letter-spacing:-0.3px">We do it right.</h3><p style="font-size:15px;color:#555;line-height:1.8">No shortcuts. No patches. Every job is done properly - safe, clean, and to spec. We don&#x27;t leave until it&#x27;s right.</p></div><div style="background:#fff;padding:40px 36px;border-top:3px solid #f0cc58"><h3 style="font-family:&quot;Satoshi&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:#021225;margin-bottom:16px;letter-spacing:-0.3px">We&#x27;re easy to deal with.</h3><p style="font-size:15px;color:#555;line-height:1.8">Straight-talking, no waffle. We communicate clearly, give fixed quotes, and don&#x27;t surprise you with hidden costs.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="about"><div class="wrap"><div class="inner"><h2>A note from our Directors</h2><blockquote>&quot;Trident was built on the belief that every home and business deserves work done right - installed properly, first time, by a team that actually picks up the phone. That&#x27;s what we set out to build, and it&#x27;s what we&#x27;re proud to deliver every day.&quot;</blockquote><div class="about-stats hidden"><div class="about-stat"><strong>500+</strong><span>Jobs completed</span></div><div class="about-stat"><strong>4.9★</strong><span>Google rating</span></div><div class="about-stat"><strong>10yr</strong><span>Serving Auckland</span></div><div class="about-stat"><strong>100%</strong><span>Licensed team</span></div></div><style>
